from pathlib import Path
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
D=R/'private-assets/exports/p15-60-transition-visual'
css='''body{background:#172331;color:#edf3fa;font:15px/1.55 system-ui;max-width:1350px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 18px}h1{font-size:24px}p{color:#cbd8e8}.warn{color:#ffc58b}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(290px,1fr));gap:14px}.card{padding:12px;background:#283b50;border-radius:7px}img{max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;background:repeating-conic-gradient(#ddd 0 25%,white 0 50%) 50%/20px 20px}input{width:100%}h2{font-size:17px}figure{margin:0}figcaption{margin-top:6px}'''
h='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>P15-60 · 名义 yaw 45-65 VDD 视觉门禁</title><style>'''+css+'''</style></head><body><h1>P15-60 · 名义 yaw 45°–65° 视觉过渡</h1><p class="warn">结论：完整图像 Crossfade 不通过视觉门禁。名义 55° 出现重叠虹膜、鼻梁/面部边界重影。此序列只是诊断，非已验证 VDD，也不代表物理相机角度。</p><div class="card"><h2>连续帧对照 · <span id="label">名义 55°（第 5/9 帧）</span></h2><input id="frameSlider" type="range" min="0" max="8" step="1" value="4" aria-label="名义视角参数"><div class="grid"><figure><img id="whole" src="frame-04.png" alt="whole frame"><figcaption>全图</figcaption></figure><figure><img id="face" src="face-04.png" alt="facial detail"><figcaption>面部裁切，检查双眼、鼻子、嘴、发夹</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h2>45° 身份基准</h2><img src="face-00.png" alt="source face"></div><div class="card"><h2>55° 双重轮廓失败帧</h2><img src="face-04.png" alt="failed midpoint"></div><div class="card"><h2>相对 +20° 候选</h2><img src="face-08.png" alt="candidate face"></div></div><p>图像算法：Premultiplied RGBA 整图线性混合，仅作为对照；未执行 ArtMesh 分层变形、鼻梁遮挡和发夹深度重排。轮廓 Alpha IoU=0.882312，眼部 ROI 两端平均灰度差 49.49。两项都不是身份验收指标。</p><script>const slider=document.getElementById('frameSlider');slider.addEventListener('input',()=>{const i=Number(slider.value);const pad=String(i).padStart(2,'0');document.getElementById('whole').src='frame-'+pad+'.png';document.getElementById('face').src='face-'+pad+'.png';document.getElementById('label').textContent='名义 '+(45+2.5*i)+'°（第 '+(i+1)+'/9 帧）';});</script></body></html>'''
(D/'index.html').write_text(h,encoding='utf8')
print('HTML ready')
